Attach an existing managed worktree or a linked checkout created with Git to the parent chat. Pass the absolute path to the checkout or its workspace directory. This tool is part of plugin `codex-app-tools`.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__codex_app__attach_worktree(args: {
  // Absolute path to an existing worktree or its workspace directory.
  path: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
